WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.550
I'm Outa Shou!

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:08.020
Former player Hanashima-san became our coach.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:10.320
Finally, the Momoyama Predators are back!

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:15.960
And I became the captain, even though I am the worst player on the team.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.000
Everyone had put me on the spot,

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.900
but I can play soccer again!

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:22.940
I'll do my best!

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:27.170
Then let's aim to become world number one... no...

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:30.010
The number one team in the entire galaxy!

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:07.770
T-These fit just a while ago...

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:12.110
That stomach's gotten a bit 
bigger while you were unemployed.

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:13.950
Oh, shut up.

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:17.580
How's this?

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:25.590
Masaru-chan, you're so funny!

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:27.860
Take that off. I'll sew up the button.

00:02:28.490 --> 00:02:30.030
Good morning!

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:32.000
I'm coming!

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.700
I'm going now.

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:40.340
Coach.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:42.910
Couldn't you at least shave that stubble?{Shouldn't you at least shave that stubble? }

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:44.910
This is basic etiquette, you know?

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:48.450
A lot happened, so I didn't have time.

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:51.550
That jacket is no good, either.

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:53.150
Right, Erika-san?

00:02:53.990 --> 00:02:56.990
Yeah, it's kinda lame.

00:02:58.160 --> 00:02:59.960
Would it have been better if I changed?{I should have changed? }

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:01.660
You would've been late then.

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:03.900
Who cares how he looks on the outside?

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:09.130
If we make that sly old man wait, nothing good will come out of it.

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:10.600
Let's go like this.

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:12.710
You make us worry, Coach.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:22.820
Well then...

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:25.780
Good morning!

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:30.120
What's wrong, Shou-kun?

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:32.760
I saw something I shouldn't have seen.

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:33.630
Huh?

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:37.030
What's wrong? Come in.

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:38.760
Can we?

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:40.400
Of course.

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:41.830
You're here to see me, right?

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:43.300
Yes!

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:46.210
So what do you want?

00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:50.480
Please let us revive the Predators' sixth grade team!

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:51.940
That again?

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:54.650
Can't you give that up already?

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:55.810
It'll be the same answer every time.

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:58.380
What if we return to the team, too?

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.990
What!?

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:05.820
I fired the coach because of the three of you.

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:11.130
Thanks to that, the players left one by one. 
That's why the sixth grade team disbanded.

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:13.700
Now you're here to apologize?

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:16.100
Not really.

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:17.070
What!?

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:18.800
Then why are you here?

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:22.340
Hanashima-san here is willing to become our coach,

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:27.150
so the Furuyas told me that they're 
willing to come back to the team, too.

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:33.120
I'm Hanashima Masaru.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:36.990
You don't look like a person who can coach kids.

00:04:36.990 --> 00:04:40.590
I feel like I've seen you somewhere.

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:49.770
Now I remember!{I remembered! }

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:54.370
You're that drunkard who comes often to our practice grounds!

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:56.540
The parents were suspicious of you!

00:04:56.540 --> 00:04:58.880
Not real beer, but low-malt beer.

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:01.310
No difference!

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:04.350
I can't let someone like that become your coach.

00:05:04.350 --> 00:05:05.850
Hey, old man!

00:05:05.850 --> 00:05:09.120
You shouldn't judge a book by its cover.

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:10.990
Have you ever looked at yourself in the mirror?{Have you looked at a mirror yourself?}

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:15.290
Um...

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:18.000
Hanashima-san was a former professional player.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.570
He was the ace for the Chiba Thunderbolts.

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:22.940
What!? A player from the J League!?

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:26.810
He was known as the Lightning Light!

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:28.640
I've heard of him.

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:29.640
Naomi-kun.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:31.040
Okay.

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:37.080
I've got it.

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:46.290
Lightning Light! The lightning-fast right foot?

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:49.900
He coached a children's soccer team after retiring.

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:53.400
His team reached the quarterfinals in the national championships.

00:05:53.400 --> 00:05:57.400
What!? National tournament? The quarterfinals?

00:05:57.400 --> 00:06:03.310
Hanashima-san, sorry for all the rude things I said.

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:05.740
Please sit over here.

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:14.150
We would be most satisfied with someone like you becoming their coach.

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:15.750
But...

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:16.720
But?

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:20.260
These three are delinquents.

00:06:20.260 --> 00:06:21.590
Hey, old man!

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:23.030
You haven't changed at all.

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:26.060
What else?

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:28.670
I just wanted to let you know.

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:31.940
You'll coach them properly, right?

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:36.170
The Furuyas want him as their coach, too.

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:40.810
Well, if everyone's happy...

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:43.080
Thank you very much.

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:45.080
Yes!

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:55.530
One, the deadline for the city tournament is 3 PM on the day after tomorrow.

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:58.660
You need to turn in a player list by then.

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:02.430
You need at least eleven players.

00:07:02.430 --> 00:07:05.400
We'll do something about that!

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:10.810
Two, you need to beat 
Tsubakimori SC, a team in our district,

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:13.150
and qualify the district tournament.

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:15.010
Tsubakimori?

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:18.480
A team managed by his business rival.

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:22.850
The guy who we had a mini game with, Suguro-kun, is their captain.

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:25.720
That kid with a nice build?

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:30.100
We're not going to lose to a team like that.

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:33.600
Anyway, if you don't qualify the district tournament,

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:36.000
your coach shall be fired.{I'll fire your coach.}

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:38.040
That's fine.

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:43.210
I think I can take these guys all the way to the top of the nation.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:46.950
The entire nation? That is amazing.

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:50.780
Okay, okay. Thank you very much.

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:54.290
You're welcome.

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:59.220
The problem is that we need to gather a total of eleven players in two days.

00:07:59.220 --> 00:08:02.460
3U should agree.

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:03.800
They love soccer.

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:05.560
Now we need three more.

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:06.530
We'll get it done somehow.

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:08.970
Can you be that relaxed?

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:13.110
We'll go ask the people who left the team one by one.

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:14.970
I'll help you!

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:18.080
Are there any people at your school who might be interested?

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:19.040
Nope.

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:24.450
You're so direct! Don't you have any friends?

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:26.650
We're delinquents, after all.

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:28.950
Don't say that so proudly! Jeez.

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:32.220
Is there anyone willing to help out from the fifth grade team?

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:34.360
Fifth graders...

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:37.360
None of them are any good.

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:40.700
Well, aren't there people who are better than Shou-kun?

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:43.370
That might be true.

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:45.100
Even Erika-chan, too.

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:46.940
You're wrong!

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:51.340
Well, we'll leave gathering teammates up to you.

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:53.510
I'm looking forward to the results, Captain.

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:55.710
So I'm the captain only in times like this?

00:08:55.710 --> 00:08:58.680
I shouldn't have agreed in the first place.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:02.190
No, you have to be the captain.

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:03.460
Right?

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:04.720
Yes.

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:05.620
Yep.

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:07.790
Really?

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:09.860
Okay! I'll do my best!

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:11.930
What a simple guy.{How simple. }

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:18.870
Oh? You got a coach? That's great.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:21.910
Becoming number one in the 
nation is not a dream anymore.

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:23.840
Erika-chan!

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:24.940
Good morning.

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:25.810
Good morning.

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:26.550
Good morning.

00:09:26.550 --> 00:09:31.380
I called Uematsu-kun and his friends, and they agreed!

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:34.650
Really? Then only three more people to go.

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:35.720
Three?

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:37.320
We don't have enough players.

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:42.490
We need to turn in the players list by 3 PM tomorrow or else we can't enter the district tournament.

00:09:42.490 --> 00:09:44.330
Help me out, Erika-chan.

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:45.600
Okay!

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.430
I'm going on ahead.{I'll be going first. }

00:09:49.030 --> 00:09:51.070
Erika-chan! Your ball!

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:55.510
You forgot it at the park...

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:58.410
The Furuyas are back!

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:00.210
We have an awesome coach, too!

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:02.780
We can even get to the national tournament!

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:04.220
It's impossible for me.

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:08.790
I can't play soccer until I get into middle school.

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.390
Don't mind. Don't mind.

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:11.520
Next up...

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:12.590
Aoki-kun!

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:14.190
I have cram school!

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:16.330
Can't you do something about that?

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:17.660
No is no.

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:19.430
We're not puppies!

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:22.100
Aren't there any other former Predator players?

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:24.170
There are three in the next class over.

00:10:24.170 --> 00:10:25.400
Let's go, then.

00:10:40.590 --> 00:10:42.990
Reika-chan, you're pretty good at soccer!

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:45.160
Eh? Really?

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:47.530
Yep! You have good soccer sense.

00:10:50.030 --> 00:10:52.630
Please! Just the district tournament is enough.{Please! Just help us out in the district tournament.}

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:53.930
Yes! Please!

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:56.070
Even if you ask me...

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:57.600
Aren't there other people?

00:10:57.600 --> 00:10:59.300
Don't say that.

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.770
No, no. Just find someone else.

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:07.980
Reika-chan, don't kick the ball in the hallways.

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:33.410
So how about it?

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:34.340
Soccer?

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:37.380
Yeah. Well, you're fast, right?

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:39.110
No, no.

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:42.450
Rejected again...{Another rejection.}

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:43.920
This is bad.

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:46.050
Don't mind. Don't mind.

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:50.060
We'll just ask all the guys in the school, one by one!

00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:54.990
Erika-chan!

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:56.660
Ah, Reika-chan.

00:11:56.660 --> 00:11:57.600
Um...

00:11:57.600 --> 00:11:59.900
Sorry, we're a bit busy.

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:01.930
Hey! Lovey-dovey today, too?

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:03.200
So hot!

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:04.400
No!

00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:07.040
Let's drag them into our team!

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:08.740
Ah, that's a good idea.

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:10.340
Sorry, Reika-chan.

00:12:10.340 --> 00:12:12.580
Hey! You two!

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:15.780
They're here!

00:12:15.780 --> 00:12:17.450
Don't run!

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:19.420
Hey!

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:21.850
Forgive us!

00:12:22.650 --> 00:12:24.560
Thank you very much.

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:36.900
What to teach off the pitch.

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:39.070
Remember the rules of society.

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:41.270
Say your greetings loud and clear.

00:12:41.270 --> 00:12:43.040
Make sure to be on time.

00:12:43.040 --> 00:12:46.880
Don't cause a ruckus on public transportation.

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:48.980
What's this all about?

00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:51.880
Hanashima? Is that you, Hanashima?

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:53.120
Mine!

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:55.850
Wow, this is pretty rare.

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:58.090
You got some meat on you.

00:12:58.090 --> 00:12:59.390
You, too.

00:12:59.390 --> 00:13:01.090
Why are you here today?

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:03.460
I'm here for a lecture on coaching kids.

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:07.670
Oh? You're coaching children again?

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:12.640
I wrote that.

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:13.870
Isn't it well written?

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:17.810
Teaching kids is fun.

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:22.010
I want to try coaching, too, but I'm too busy at the Association.

00:13:22.010 --> 00:13:24.320
There's the Olympics this year, too.

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:28.350
I can clone myself an unlimited number of times and there will still be work to be done.

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:32.960
So what team are you coaching?

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:34.490
A junior FC team?

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:35.390
No.

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:41.070
I guess so. Becoming a club team's coach is pretty tough.

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:43.440
So many people are vying for a few spots.

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:45.100
What team, then?

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:49.210
A team managed by a local real estate businessman.

00:13:49.210 --> 00:13:56.280
Oh? But the team must feel lucky to be coached by the Lightning Light.

00:13:56.280 --> 00:14:01.350
I've met many coaches here during work, 
and I don't think you should work too hard.

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:05.120
Are you gonna give it your all?

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:09.260
The kids won't like that.

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:12.030
So you're saying that you aren't cut out for this?

00:14:12.900 --> 00:14:14.500
Maybe.

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:17.870
I can't be dallying around here.

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:21.010
Sorry about that. We'll talk later. Bye.

00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:23.040
Hey, Mine!

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:24.180
What is it?

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:29.350
When you were a player, you thought about going to La Liga or Serie A, didn't you?

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:32.150
I was born 5 years too early.

00:14:32.150 --> 00:14:36.250
The road is all clear for this generation. 
When I was playing, I didn't have the luxury.

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:39.620
So you couldn't forge your own path?

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:41.290
Unlike Nataka Hidetoshi.

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:43.160
But that's the truth.

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:45.030
He was someone special.

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:46.460
How boring!

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:48.270
It's all soccer.

00:14:48.270 --> 00:14:54.240
What the kids play at the park and what Del Piero and Ronaldo play.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:56.310
Soccer does not discriminate.

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:59.480
How can someone who doesn't 
challenge himself ever hope to rise up?

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:03.980
Cut me some slack. I'm really busy.

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:20.530
So nothing went well.

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:22.230
We still have one day.

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:23.640
In any case, we have practice.

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:24.570
Okay.

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:26.740
Erika-chan.

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:32.480
I-I have something to ask you, Erika-chan.

00:15:34.010 --> 00:15:36.110
Go on ahead, Shou-kun.

00:15:36.110 --> 00:15:38.080
Okay. Later.

00:15:39.150 --> 00:15:40.620
What's wrong, Reika-chan?

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:43.350
Actually, I...

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:47.090
Next!

00:15:56.230 --> 00:16:01.210
The goalkeeper and that midfielder who just shot the ball both look pretty good.

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:04.310
As expected of Coach Hanashima; you've got good eyes.

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:08.310
Those two used to play with the sixth grade team.

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:11.850
Hey, can we borrow those two?

00:16:11.850 --> 00:16:16.450
Well, if the manager says so. But only those two.

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:18.690
We have matches to play, too.

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:25.000
Kubota! Tanaka! Get over here!

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:30.840
Kubota-kun and Tanaka-kun are joining us, it seems.

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:34.140
With those two, we have enough skill.

00:16:34.140 --> 00:16:36.210
One more, huh?

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:38.680
Eh? Where's Erika-san?

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:43.350
She's chatting with her friend. She'll be back soon.

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:49.250
Gather around, sixth grade team!

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:52.420
These two will be joining your team today.

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:54.090
Thank you very much!

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:59.400
What? We have sunk so low that we need two fifth grade brats?

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:05.840
Ouzou-senpai, both Kubota and I have been 
chosen to train at the district training center.

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:07.040
So what?

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:10.210
We've gotten much better.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:12.440
I wonder about that.

00:17:12.440 --> 00:17:17.750
The district training center just follows the manual. There's a limit to how good you can get.

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:24.560
All I see is you three complaining, but I don't see anyone from your school.

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:27.890
There is no point in inviting people weaker than us.

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:30.600
I'm sorry I'm late.

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:33.160
Oh? Two more people?

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:35.330
Let me introduce them, Erika-chan.

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:38.900
They are from the fifth grade team - Tanaka-kun and Kubota-kun.

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:41.870
I'm Takatou Erika! Nice to meet you!

00:17:42.510 --> 00:17:43.540
A girl?

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:45.580
They're better than you two.

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:52.550
Kota-kun's right. Her dribbling speed is out of this world.

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:56.220
Well, we'll see when we practice together.

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:58.820
Shou, we need one more by tomorrow.

00:17:58.820 --> 00:18:02.390
Well, I've been all over...

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:04.760
Oh yeah, about that!

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:07.270
I've found one more!

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:08.770
Really!?

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:10.540
Reika-chan, come here!

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:11.940
Eh?

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:13.870
Eh!?

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:22.280
Shou-kun knows her, too. She's 
Saionji Reika-chan from our class.

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:25.250
Nice to meet all of you.

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:28.090
Can she really play soccer?

00:18:28.090 --> 00:18:31.360
We were practicing together.

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:33.490
She has good soccer sense.

00:18:36.230 --> 00:18:39.260
If Erika-chan says so, then it must be so.

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:40.930
Let's do our best, Reika-chan.

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:43.900
Okay! Thank you very much!

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:45.940
But look...

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:47.440
Right?

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:51.640
Saionji-san, why have you decided to join?

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:56.910
Soccer is fun. Besides, I can go on a diet, too.

00:18:57.880 --> 00:19:00.620
Diet!? Are you making fun of soccer!?

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:04.560
We all have different goals!

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:06.220
What did you say!?

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:13.000
Now, now, Kota-kun. We need all the players we've got.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:17.600
Yeah! And Erika-chan says it's okay!

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:18.400
Hmph!

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:22.570
That's right. We finally have our eleven people.

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:24.380
Let's go, then!

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:26.910
Erika, Saionji, start warming up.

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:28.410
The rest of you, practice passing.

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:29.650
Okay!

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:36.450
One, two...

00:19:48.070 --> 00:19:49.500
Break for five minutes!

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:57.780
Looks like Saionji requires a special training menu.

00:19:57.780 --> 00:20:00.610
You'll be practicing the 
fundamentals with me after the break.

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:01.510
Okay.

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:14.430
Don't rush it. Focus on the ball, then kick.

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:55.430
Okay! Nice shot!

00:20:55.430 --> 00:20:56.270
Nice!

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:57.700
Nice pass!

00:20:57.700 --> 00:21:00.070
That's the level of the district training center?

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:01.410
Yeah, really.

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:02.440
Shou!

00:21:07.610 --> 00:21:09.010
The captain's armband!

00:21:09.010 --> 00:21:10.380
Go!

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:12.380
Okay.

00:21:14.490 --> 00:21:15.650
Everyone!

00:21:15.650 --> 00:21:19.090
We can finally enter tournaments! 
Please don't mess up the teamwork!

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:24.400
You gotta say something like 
"Look at this captain's armband!"

00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:26.660
Come on, Captain.

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:30.130
I-I can't do something like that. Jeez.

00:21:33.940 --> 00:21:36.610
Kubota-kun! Tanaka-kun! Let's do our best!

00:21:36.610 --> 00:21:37.840
O-Okay!

00:22:04.570 --> 00:22:07.410
Shou-kun is so nervous.

00:22:12.540 --> 00:22:15.550
Momoyama Predators - Block B, Group 2.

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:24.590
We'll be meeting in the second round, Furuya. You're going down this time.

00:22:24.590 --> 00:22:25.490
Suguro.

00:22:25.490 --> 00:22:29.060
Make sure you qualify the first round before that.

00:22:29.060 --> 00:22:30.290
What did you say!?

00:22:30.290 --> 00:22:34.570
Now, now. We can decide this on the pitch.

00:22:43.040 --> 00:22:47.250
You have to beat Tsubakimori.

00:22:47.250 --> 00:22:50.850
I got it. Don't worry.

00:22:54.720 --> 00:22:55.850
What's wrong?

00:24:35.920 --> 00:24:38.660
What do Aoto-kun and Kageura-kun want?

00:24:38.660 --> 00:24:40.790
We're finally gonna play some matches!

00:24:40.790 --> 00:24:43.890
Coach Hanashima! Teach us some tactics!

00:24:43.890 --> 00:24:47.000
Shou-kun! Something's wrong with Reika-chan!

00:24:47.000 --> 00:24:49.030
She's challenging the coach secretly on her own?

00:24:49.030 --> 00:24:51.240
You're crazy, Reika-chan!

00:24:51.240 --> 00:24:54.170
Next episode of Ginga e Kickoff! "The Three Tactics."
